WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:37.040
While we were making a side trip, Leina and
Roux took off for the La Vie en Rose.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.710
I make Leina suffer by being a bad brother,
but she didn't have to go out there herself!

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:44.090
I tried to get her back, of course!

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:47.430
I almost caught up,
but some Axis guy got her.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:51.310
Man, I'm worried.
I have to get Leina back, and fast!

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:57.020
LITTLE SISTER!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:20.210
What's going on?
Are those all the workers you have?

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:24.720
One, two, three...
I count maybe ten in there.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:28.850
We've got our hands full
bringing in supplies from Granada.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:35.020
Kim, four coffees to green deck, please.
Don't forget the milk.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.140
These kids today are no good.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:41.110
And you're short-staffed. Overhauling the
Argama is out of the question.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.740
We'll do it.
Captain Bright asked me to.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:49.030
While we speed away from
that enemy ship, we'll get it done!

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:51.330
I'm hoping you will.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:00.330
You wanted to talk, Captain?
Is it about Judau?

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:03.920
A little secret talk?
That's why you didn't invite him.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.050
Let's cut to the chase then.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.930
I want you all to
keep an eye on Judau.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.600
If we leave him alone,
I have a feeling...

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:15.470
he'll go off on his own to rescue Leina,
and we can't let that happen.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:18.940
Could you all please show
a little more naval decorum?!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.530
Don't say it!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.160
Judau, where are you going?!
The Argama's being overhauled!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.610
To help with the
Double Zeta's maintenance!

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.030
Judau!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:33.620
I made this!
Want a taste?

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.740
- Later.
- No! Now!

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.170
Okay.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.800
I think this soup's really good!

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:43.050
Well? Is it good?

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.250
Judau!

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.800
Going to the bathroom
isn't against orders!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.130
Wanna try some, Roux?

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:49.970
Later.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.970
Where's Judau?

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.930
- Bathroom.
- Oh.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:56.350
Do I need your permission
to go to the bathroom?!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.440
Sorry. Go ahead.

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:02.520
That temper comes
from a calcium deficiency.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.670
That's why you need
to have my stew!

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:07.690
Judau?

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.530
Elle? You alone?

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:10.580
Yeah.

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.620
Gotcha!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.130
...the hell?

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.120
Judau? How'd you
get that normal suit?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.960
I hid it in the supply closet.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.460
And the pipe...?

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.210
Agh! The pipe!

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.300
Now I'll just steal the Double Zeta
and blast off into space!

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.340
You'll never do it!
Everyone's watching you!

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:36.930
I'm going anyway! Anyone who
gets in my way will get this!

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.640
I know how you feel--

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.850
No, you don't!
She's my one and only sister!

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.270
She's way
smarter than me,

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:46.060
and maybe a little stubborn,
but her cooking's great!

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.190
So why did she get
captured by the enemy?!

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.360
J-Judau! Calm down!

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:53.620
We'll talk this over with Iino.
Don't be hasty!

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:56.000
Leina...

00:04:57.090 --> 00:05:00.840
I'm a terrible brother.
And I hate myself for it...

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:03.960
I envy Leina.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.800
Huh? Why?

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:11.660
I'm an only child. I've never had
a sibling who'd worry about me like that.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.840
- Where's Judau?
- Bathroom. He should be out soon.

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.180
I need to go, too.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.720
Someone's coming in.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.060
Hey, Captain! Wanna taste?

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.690
Sorry, I'm full.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:26.020
Hiya, Captain!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:27.520
Hi, Captain!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.980
You're both cleaning the bathroom?

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:32.530
What?
It's broken down again.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:35.710
This isn't working.
It'd be faster by hand.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.040
Judau!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.330
Who's moving it?!

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.630
Mondo!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.420
You're trying to dock it here?!

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.340
We can't?

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:50.920
No!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.630
Shouldn't we get used to it?

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.600
Transforming Core Fighter!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.550
Don't break it!

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:58.350
All right! All right!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.270
Almost got it! Slowly!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:05.740
If we do it too slow,
it won't be like real combat!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.940
Now we'll do a docking
test with the Core Base.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.440
Watch the positioning for me.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:12.660
Go on!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:17.610
A little more right! Right!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.300
I can see it, too.
Check the joint sections!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.170
I got my eyes on them.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:28.330
Okay, the joints
are connecting!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.090
Looking good. Lock it in!

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:36.680
I guess it's hard to figure out
the Double Zeta without doing this.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.340
Okay, then.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.800
Release the crane!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.860
Can you transform it from
the Core Top's cockpit, too?

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.980
There we go!

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.660
Shields, reconfigured.
All sections fully open.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.700
Okay, deploying hands!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.530
Raising backpack.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:59.040
Nozzles, fully open!
Transform, left and right sides!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:03.000
And hello there, Mr. Double.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.790
We did it!

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.670
Well done, my dear Mondo!

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:11.130
Now, if we can just take
him as a souvenir...

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.850
Beecha! Not so loud!

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:15.170
We'll ditch all the crap work
on the Argama...

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.590
which is like we're Judau's assistants.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:19.050
We're not getting
stuck with that role.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:22.140
The question is, when do
we take the Double Zeta.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:24.010
Let's check the control systems!

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.640
Judau, no!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.230
Why not mind your own business,
instead of...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.190
That's enough! Unhook it!

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.950
We still need to do
separate launch tests!

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.450
The Double Zeta. It's moving?

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.160
Iino! We need to talk!

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.410
- Elle! Thank you!
- Judau!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.330
Somebody, grab Judau!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.040
He's getting in the Double Zeta!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.360
Judau! Don't you dare!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.710
Let me go!

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.840
Calm down, you idiot!

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:01.340
Lemme go!
I'm going to save my sister!

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.850
Leina!

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:14.050
Don't poke at it like that.
Use your knife.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.940
I've had it! It won't cut!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.530
You shouldn't make
a sound while eating.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.570
Nor move excessively while eating.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:22.070
I want to go to the bathroom.

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:26.660
Th-The bathroom? One doesn't
mention such things during a meal!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.000
You may not!

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:29.830
Then I'll do it here!

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.670
W-Wait!
All right. I get it.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.380
Just this once.

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.550
Get going.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.270
Right!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.090
Wait!

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:43.340
Now what?

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:46.850
There's etiquette to observe when
leaving a table during a meal.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:54.350
The proper way is to put your
napkin like this when leaving the table.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.230
Keep that in mind.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:57.790
Right!

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.740
Off I go!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.710
That might be overdoing it.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.670
No, I'll go.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:11.250
You saw the dummy
asteroid outside, right?

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.080
That's our new weapon
for finishing the Argama.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.930
We're going to use it
for a sneak attack.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:20.300
You just have to transport the
dummy asteroid with your Gaza-D.

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.810
Fighting will be
my responsibility.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.480
It looks like you
don't care for combat.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.440
I try to avoid piloting mobile
suits as much as possible.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.310
It's mentally exhausting.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:40.660
Why not send
Glemy Toto out, instead?

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:45.030
He's one of Lady Haman's favorites.
I can't put him in too much danger.

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:46.740
But you can with me?

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:50.330
You aren't as important!
Any complaints and I'll demote you!

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:52.420
Yes, ma'am! Understood!

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.260
Even if I can control my emotions,
my body disobeys me!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:05.560
Even so, I have to go!

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.950
This feeling...

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:29.790
R-Jarja, moving out!
Outta my way, everyone!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:39.970
Mistress Chara, can we launch
without any mayhem, please?

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:44.840
Leina, where are you going?

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.550
Back to my brother!

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.600
What are you talking about?

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.140
Behave yourself, Leina.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:55.500
Until Roux comes, you...

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.860
Did we fly into an asteroid field?

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:10.990
Mistress Chara, that's enough psyching
yourself up. Can we get going now?

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.880
Not yet!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:19.130
Lemme out!
Lemme out of here!

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.390
I have to get out of here,
no matter what!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:37.140
We have to get Judau
out of there somehow.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.560
Think he can do it?

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.270
He's really worried
about his sister.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:41.440
What do we do?

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:45.150
If Judau goes out in the Double Zeta,
I'll go in the Mk. II.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:46.150
You, too?

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:48.740
I'd worry if he
went out alone!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.880
Hang on, Leina.
I'll be coming for you soon!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.740
Miss Anna! Fire! There's a fire!

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.530
Huh? What's wrong?!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:32.660
We have to get Judau
out before it's too late!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.320
The key! Give me the key!

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:36.000
Right! Take care of it!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.040
Judau!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.250
Judau?

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.830
What's all this smoke?

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.540
It's a waste,
but I burned up my stew!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.380
Judau, hurry!

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:50.010
Those kids tricked me!

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.340
- I blew it!
- Is there a fire somewhere?

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.350
No! Judau's flown the coop!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.680
Huh? He did what?!

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:01.020
Captain! Judau's escaped
from the mess hall!

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:01.940
What?

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.190
Captain Bright!

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.650
They're at it again?!

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.370
Don't!

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:12.450
Kids! If you do this...!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.450
You can't stop Judau!

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:15.950
Thanks, Shinta! Qum!

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.030
- Judau!
- Roux!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:20.980
Okay, is it this one?
Or not? Maybe this one?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.430
Screen, on!

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:25.590
It worked! Amazing!

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:29.510
That girl!

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:33.840
- Can you do anything by yourself?!!
- I won't cause trouble for the Argama!

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:36.010
Don't you get that
this is causing trouble?!

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:38.990
Stop it, Roux Louka!
Let go of Judau!

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:40.560
I said let him go!

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:42.150
Who's that? Elle?

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.490
Hang on, Leina!
I'm coming to save you!

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:55.070
I'd honestly prefer a pilot suit.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:57.460
We're lucky we got
our hands on these.

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:01.200
Beecha! Mondo!

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.120
What are you doing with normal suits?

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:05.620
Never mind that!
Get to the mobile suit deck!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.040
- Yeah! You have to stop Judau!
- Let go! I know the way!

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:11.210
- What's the difference?!
- Be our guest!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:14.220
H-Hey! Get away! Stay back!

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.640
Elle, can you pilot that thing?

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:21.220
I'm doing it already!

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:24.260
Um, this one? Or not...

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:26.850
The Mk. II, as well?
Who's in it?

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.150
Elle.
Elle's in the Mk. II!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:30.450
Elle?!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:35.610
Captain Bright! Are you okay?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.750
Yes.
Beecha! Mondo!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.750
Iino, what's the holdup?!
Get the hatch open!

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.450
If it doesn't open,
I'll blast it open!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.960
Judau, keep calm!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:50.330
Iino will tell us what to do
from the control room!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.430
Then tell him to hurry!

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.630
Judau, there's a control switch
on the hatch bulkhead!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.810
Rotate it to open the hatch!

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:00.600
Gotcha!

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:02.930
Hatch is opening!

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:04.930
All hands,
please retreat to the airlocks!

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.100
Dammit, Iino,
you're in on this, too?

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:09.150
Captain, get to the airlock!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:14.730
Judau, we can talk this over!
Don't be stupid!

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:18.120
You're just going to provoke Axis!
Judau Ashta!

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:21.960
I can't believe Elle
got the Mk. II working...

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:26.160
Elle, you're not ready.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.810
I'm fine!
I won't get in your way.

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.000
But...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.540
I'll learn while flying.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.750
The two of us encourage
each other, right?

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.550
I suppose, but...

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:36.970
I'm going!

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:42.510
That's the way! Elle's got a
good feel for these things.

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.310
Judau!
Double Zeta, here I go!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.860
Looks like we
managed to get out.

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:55.230
Now what?

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.660
We'll think of that when we make
contact with the enemy ship.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:05.660
- Elle, how's it going?
- Fine. I've kind of got the hang of it.

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:06.960
Judau!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:17.710
This dummy asteroid's heavy. Maybe
because Mistress Chara's grabbing on to it.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.880
That's a hell of a thing
to say in zero gravity!

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.680
You heard that?

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:27.700
The enemy!
What happened to my radar?

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.930
Mistress Chara!
Enemy mobile suits, dead ahead!

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:31.240
What?!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.200
They're coming for us?

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.480
The actual Double Zeta!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.130
Yeah!

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:52.330
Judau, let go!
I can do this myself!

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.630
You're not ready!
They fixed that thing already?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.710
Gottn!
Detonate the dummy asteroid!

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:01.090
We'll snare the Double Zeta
in the spider-web bombs!

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:04.840
But I worked hard to bring it this far
so we could blow up the Argama.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.720
Quit your bitching
or I'll demote you!

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.970
Understood, ma'am!
I'm doing it!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.870
What the...?

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:30.040
This is the end
of the Double Zeta!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.120
The spider-web bombs
will snare him!

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.410
Long live Axis!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.250
Got it! It's this one!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.630
Beam rifle, fire!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.640
I'm not afraid of
the Double Zeta!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:53.180
I'm just scared
of being demoted!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:00.820
I don't have time to play with you!
I'm going to save my little sister!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:01.940
What? Sister?

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:04.410
Yeah, so stay out of my way!

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:06.950
What's your sister's name?

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.160
Leina!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.620
Leina?
The girl Glemy brought back?

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:14.380
That's it! Run away fast, or the
big bad wolf will eat you!

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:18.500
And there was never a wolf
that was as cute as me!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:19.970
What?

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.850
The Double Zeta's
running for it?!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:27.470
You can't escape, Double Zeta.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:28.180
Let go!

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.980
I'll fight you later!
Leina comes first!

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:35.020
Leina is the little sister of
the Double Zeta's pilot?!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:37.900
Yes, sir. Gottn says
we should bring her out...

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.360
to the catapult deck
to use as a hostage.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.190
I can't do something
that underhanded!

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:44.030
We're just fighting one suit!

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:45.740
No, the Mk. II's
appeared, too.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.030
The Mk. II?
Who's the pilot?

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:49.530
We don't know, sir.

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:50.450
Ask Gottn!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.450
The Mk. II's pilot?

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:55.040
I'm too busy to be
making small talk!

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:56.760
- Ask!
- Fine!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:01.800
Judau! I'm coming to help!
When did...?!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.590
Forget your beam saber?

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:07.930
None of your business!

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:08.840
A woman, huh?

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.100
Excuse me for being a girl!

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:13.540
What the...?

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:17.190
The Mk. II's pilot is a woman?
Right! Understood!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.030
The Mk. II's pilot may be Roux Louka!

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.570
The enemy's attacking!

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:26.740
The Double Zeta's come?!

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:28.240
Look how happy she is.

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:31.820
The Double Zeta's pilot
must be Leina's brother.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.740
Well? Has the Double Zeta
come or not?

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:38.250
We'll go and see. So, get that
normal suit on at once.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.630
Okay!

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.460
I said let go!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.970
Who would do that?!

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.550
Judau, move away!

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.560
Gimme a break!
Is she taking me into it?!

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:02.660
- Get in my way and I'll shoot you down!
- Hold it, Double Zeta! Look over there!

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.040
Leina?

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:23.790
Leina!

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:27.430
Surrender! Do that,
and her life will be spared!

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.880
Big Brother!

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:36.360
The Mk. II!
Roux Louka's in there!

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:43.650
I'm not that easy.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.070
Oh...!

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:46.900
Your move, Double Zeta!

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:49.120
What do you mean,
"my move"?

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.860
Am I supposed to say
"Sure, whatever. Bye!"

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.110
This is bad.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.700
End of the line.
We're outta here!

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:55.830
How?

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.830
We'll separate the Core Top
and run for it!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.500
Can we do that?

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:00.500
I think so.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.750
Here we go!
Hang on tight!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.590
One, two, GO!

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:14.180
What?! It split in two?!

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.610
Judau!

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:27.660
Uh-oh!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:34.110
Shame on you, Gottn!
You're demoted!

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:36.820
I did my best, Mistress Chara!

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.120
I didn't see it!

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:39.330
Aw...

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:43.790
Big Brother!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.510
Leina!

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:50.470
Judau!

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.560
Those two must be Newtypes.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:05.810
I wouldn't go that far.

00:22:06.060 --> 00:22:07.730
No, they must be!

00:22:07.730 --> 00:22:10.320
This is great!
We have two Newtypes!

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.650
Where are Beecha and Mondo?

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:14.860
No sign of them
anywhere, sir.

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:16.370
What?

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:19.330
Judau, are you hurt?

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:21.500
Judau!

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:26.000
Leina... Hang on!

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:28.080
I swear I'll save you!

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:29.720
I swear!

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:51.520
Thanks to our wandering into an old
colony, we run into Chara from the Endra.

00:23:51.520 --> 00:23:54.860
I make friends with two pretty
girls named Sarasa and Rasara...

00:23:54.860 --> 00:23:57.400
to the point I seem
to forget about Leina.

00:23:57.400 --> 00:24:02.280
But if Gottn's trying to pull a dirty
trick here, I'm ready for it!

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.830
Even if he uses
Gaza-Cs or Ds or Rs!

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:08.840
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Phantom Colony."

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:10.970
There's nothing scarier than
a big fish in a little pond.

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
THE PHANTOM COLONY

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
(Part 1)

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time
